 "findings": {
  "confirmed": [
   {
    "claim": "El módulo Employees (hr) de Odoo 17 está bajo LGPL-3 y es una aplicación instalable. Forma parte del repositorio odoo/odoo, es decir, de Community.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-37425daa3f9339592650a1fe"
    ],
    "quote": "'license': 'LGPL-3',",
    "locator": "hr/__manifest__.py, final del archivo"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Attendances (hr_attendance) está en el código LGPL-3, depende de hr y barcodes, e incluye un quiosco de asistencia.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-b8c35ba02fd9c075c78097c5"
    ],
    "quote": "'depends': ['hr', 'barcodes'],",
    "locator": "hr_attendance/__manifest__.py"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Time Off (hr_holidays) está en el código LGPL-3. Cubre solicitudes y asignaciones de ausencias, planes de acumulación y reportes.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-c79d1b4939c6be83e7dd08e8"
    ],
    "quote": "Allocate PTOs and follow leaves requests",
    "locator": "hr_holidays/__manifest__.py, summary"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Employee Contracts (hr_contract) está en el código LGPL-3. Permite varios contratos por empleado.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-b36a5369b3ab9a25b783cbb3"
    ],
    "quote": "You can assign several contracts per employee.",
    "locator": "hr_contract/__manifest__.py, description"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Work Entries (hr_work_entry) está en el código LGPL-3 y depende solo de hr.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-037e72e153a425c6de92ec3a"
    ],
    "quote": "'summary': 'Manage work entries',",
    "locator": "hr_work_entry/__manifest__.py"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Project está en el código LGPL-3.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-1131de0d272d50c0f95a4512"
    ],
    "quote": "'summary': 'Organize and plan your projects',",
    "locator": "project/__manifest__.py"
   },
   {
    "claim": "hr_timesheet (Task Logs) está en el código LGPL-3. Registra el tiempo del empleado en tareas.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-46ed579436e0c06ad5925bf5"
    ],
    "quote": "'summary': 'Track employee time on tasks',",
    "locator": "hr_timesheet/__manifest__.py"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Skills Management (hr_skills) está en el código LGPL-3. Gestiona habilidades y currículum del empleado.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-d215abd31d03d27588e7d06d"
    ],
    "quote": "'summary': 'Manage skills, knowledge and resume of your employees',",
    "locator": "hr_skills/__manifest__.py"
   },
   {
    "claim": "El repositorio de Odoo 17 se publica bajo LGPLv3.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-abc09dad5f84a76e1b027923"
    ],
    "quote": "Odoo is published under the GNU LESSER GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE, Version 3",
    "locator": "LICENSE, inicio"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Modelos de hr con ACL: hr.employee, hr.employee.public, hr.department, hr.job, hr.work.location, hr.departure.reason, hr.contract.type y hr.employee.category.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-a06eda17816585213f3c7602"
    ],
    "quote": "access_hr_employee_user,hr.employee user,model_hr_employee,group_hr_user,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Modelos de hr_attendance con ACL: hr.attendance y hr.attendance.overtime.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-102c1a7619621105c0c3db80"
    ],
    "quote": "access_hr_attendance_admin,hr.attendance.admin,model_hr_attendance,group_hr_attendance_manager,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr_attendance/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Modelos de hr_holidays con ACL: hr.leave, hr.leave.allocation, hr.leave.type, hr.leave.accrual.plan, hr.leave.accrual.level, hr.leave.mandatory.day y vistas de reporte.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-765f2d2940ce95958e04d5ec"
    ],
    "quote": "access_hr_holidays_manager_allocation,hr.holidays.manager.allocation,model_hr_leave_allocation,hr_holidays.group_hr_holidays_manager,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr_holidays/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "hr_contract expone hr.contract y hr.contract.history (solo lectura). Su ACL incluye hr.payroll.structure.type.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-2a8f2f2f6b485c26c50de8f0"
    ],
    "quote": "access_hr_contract_manager,hr.contract.manager,model_hr_contract,hr_contract.group_hr_contract_manager,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr_contract/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "hr_work_entry expone hr.work.entry y hr.work.entry.type.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-c41389a673a2c31ef12b1999"
    ],
    "quote": "access_hr_work_entry_type_manager,access_hr_work_entry_type_manager,model_hr_work_entry_type,hr.group_hr_manager,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr_work_entry/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "Modelos de project con ACL: project.project, project.task, project.task.type, project.milestone, project.update, project.collaborator, project.tags y project.task.recurrence.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-f26e563e35bb160b54b41455"
    ],
    "quote": "access_project_task,project.task,model_project_task,project.group_project_user,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "project/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "hr_timesheet registra las horas en account.analytic.line y añade el reporte timesheets.analysis.report.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-1ac5099c9af2938b6c892129"
    ],
    "quote": "access_account_analytic_line_user,analytic.account.analytic.line.timesheet.user,analytic.model_account_analytic_line,hr_timesheet.group_hr_timesheet_user,1,1,1,1",
    "locator": "hr_timesheet/security/ir.model.access.csv"
   },
   {
    "claim": "La API externa de Odoo 17 usa XML-RPC: el endpoint xmlrpc/2/object (execute_kw) llama métodos de los modelos. Qué modelos y métodos responden depende de los módulos instalados y de las ACL y reglas de registro de cada modelo; la cita acredita el endpoint, no permisos.",
    "artifact_ids": [
     "SA-feb2d58ab234aa5458fb93f1"
    ],
    "quote": "The second endpoint is ``xmlrpc/2/object``. It is used to call methods of odoo",
    "locator": "External API, Calling methods"
   },
   {
    "claim": "La doc de API externa indica que en Odoo Online el acceso no está disponible en los planes One App Free y Standard.",
    "artifact_ids": [
